  "operation": "Resolve the existing verified monster TempEntityId and GridTransformComponent.BodyRangeInfos at initial formal-monster assembly before skills/passives. Arena role players and configured summons retain their separate identity/footprint assembly. Offline legacy restoration repairs only the known missing-template/default-single-cell signature, preserving explicit bodies/templates and all other serialized combat state. Saved weekly counters/timelines select restoration rather than fresh battle initialization; pre-initialization saves still initialize normally. Reuse the current source camera radius formula without changing original art transforms or lens settings."
